{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemProfile"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemProfile\/init()"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemProfile\/timings"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SystemProfile","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Insert a profile into a world to find out where a schedule spends its time. Every schedule","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that runs on the world then records each system’s runs in it:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","world.resources.insert(SystemProfile())","world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 100), Velocity(dx: 0, dy: 0))","","let frame = Schedule {","    Gravity()","    Movement().after(Gravity.self)","}","frame.run(on: &world)","frame.run(on: &world)","","let timings = world.resources[SystemProfile.self].timings","print(timings.map(\\.name))","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Gravity\", \"Movement\"]\"","print(timings.map(\\.runs))","\/\/ Prints \"[2, 2]\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemTiming"},{"type":"text","text":" also holds the total, average, longest and latest time of the system’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"runs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A run’s time covers the system’s own work, measured on a continuous clock: not its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conditions, nor the commands it queued, which apply after its wave. A system its conditions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"skip doesn’t run, so nothing is recorded for it. Systems in the same wave run at the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time, so their times can add up to more than the wave took. Insert a new profile to start"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"over."}]}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SystemProfile","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Systems"}],"externalID":"s:7Systems13SystemProfileV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SystemProfile"}],"title":"SystemProfile","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Profiling.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Systems\/Profiling.swift#L77"}},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A resource that records how long each system takes to run."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/systemprofile"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Profiling","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemTiming"],"anchor":"Profiling","generated":true}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource","doc:\/\/Systems\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Systems\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Resource":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":